{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2019-10-07 11:30:00', 'title': "UK'S CMA SAYS ECOLAB MUST SELL OFF HOLCHEM TO PREVENT POTENTIAL PRICE RISES, LOWER QUALITY OF SERVICE", 'text': "UK'S CMA - DECIDED THAT ECOLAB MUST SELL OFF HOLCHEM TO PREVENT POTENTIAL PRICE RISES OR A LOWER QUALITY OF SERVICE AS A RESULT OF THEIR MERGER.UK'S CMA - DECISION ON ECOLAB/HOLCHEM FOLLOWS PHASE 2 INVESTIGATION, WHICH CONCLUDED MERGED CO LIKELY TO FACE LIMITED COMPETITION FROM OTHER SUPPLIERS.UK'S CMA - REGARDING ECOLAB/HOLCHEM MERGER, CONCLUDED ONLY EFFECTIVE WAY OF ADDRESSING SIGNIFICANT LOSS OF COMPETITION IS TO EFFECTIVELY BLOCK MERGER.CMA, ON ECOLAB/HOLCHEM DEAL, SAYS CONCERNED DEAL COULD MEAN FOOD & DRINK MAKERS FACE HIGHER PRICES OR LOWER QUALITY OF SERVICE FOR CLEANING CHEMICALS."}{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2019-10-07 10:30:00', 'title': 'ECOLAB TO REVIEW THE UK COMPETITION AND MARKETS AUTHORITY’S DECISION TO OPPOSE ECOLAB’S HOLCHEM ACQUISITION', 'text': 'ECOLAB TO REVIEW THE UK COMPETITION AND MARKETS AUTHORITY’S DECISION TO OPPOSE ECOLAB’S PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED HOLCHEM ACQUISITION.ECOLAB INC - CMA CONCLUDED THAT MERGER MAY RESULT IN A SUBSTANTIAL LESSENING OF COMPETITION IN UK AND COULD LEAD TO AN INCREASE IN PRICES.ECOLAB INC - CMA ORDERED ECOLAB TO DIVEST HOLCHEM.ECOLAB INC - ECOLAB "STRONGLY DISAGREES" WITH CMA\'S DECISION.'}